    "goal": "Extrude bioink through the UV-5 (300 µm) nozzle along an 8896 µm G-code path at 1.71 mm/min, filling a 46411 µm footprint at 857 µm line pitch; report fill lines, deposition rate and print time.",
    "rationale": "Pure bioprinting calculation. Fill lines = ceil(footprint width / line pitch) = ceil(46411/857) = 55 lines. Print time = path length / feed rate = 8896 µm / 1.71 mm/min = 312.1 s. Extrusion volume per path = π(d/2)²·L = π(150 µm)²·8896 µm = 628.8 nL. Deposition rate = extrusion volume / print time = 628.8 nL / 312.1 s = 2.014 nL/s = 120.9 nL/min. Ink density (1.062 g/cm³) is provided but not needed for these three outputs (would be used for filament mass).",
